Z||000000||FieroSTETZ||10-09-1999||02:15 PM||||can someone send me a picture of the CTS? i cannot find it in my chilton's manual... mine needs replacing but i can't find it. i know the area (basically) but i do not know what it looks like. oh, also, my hood decided not to open anymore, and it looks like the latch jammed so the cable (emergency and regular) will not open it. anyone have any ideas on how to get the hood open without the cables? thanks for replies on either! /BTW i have an '86 SE 2M6.. danke!<BR>||||reg||1
